# ROM manifest of Super Buster Bros. (US 901001), the US version of Super Pang (MAME clone
# sbbros). The layout is pang.manifest's, see there. The keys are MAME's sbbros_decode, the
# same that jotego's MRA header gives for sbbros. Characters in the pairs spu_02/spu_04 then
# spj_03/spj_05, sprites spu_10/spu_09. The EEPROM section is MAME's default
# eeprom-sbbros.bin, swapped as in spang.manifest. game_id 1.

set     sbbros
title   Super Buster Bros. (US 901001)
zip     spang.zip
total   1507460
board   9
mirror  18176
screen  upright
# the file make_rom.py builds from roms/spang.zip, the candidate for the firmware's digest list
known   c8828e85a74e4cb98317a13fda6e4bc52d4e857d0bd885a4a6d7ed9d8c729fb2 MAME sbbros
# RetroAchievements game: Super Pang's set (see pang.manifest).
ra      12239
short   Super Buster Bros.
# the file make_rom.py builds from roms/spang.zip, the candidate for the firmware's digest list
kabuki  45670123 45670123 2130 12

